mprovement across the tasks (refer toTable 4andAppendix A.4.2). These results demonstrate that video self-supervised pretraining benefits from increased temporal resolution during both training and evaluation. Although we experimented with scaling to even longer video clips (128 and 256 frames), we did not observe any further improvement beyond 64 frames on this set of understanding tasks.\n3V-JEPA 2-AC: Learning an Action-Conditioned World Model\nAfter pre-training, the V-JEPA 2 model can make predictions about missing part in videos. However, these predictions do not directly take into account the causal effect of actions that an agent might take. In the next stage of training, described in this section, we focus on making the model useful for planning by leveraging a small amount of interaction data. To that end, we learn a frame-causal action-conditioned predictor on top of the frozen V-JEPA 2 video encoder (Figure 2, right). We train our model on data from the Droid dataset (Khazatsky et al.,2024) consisting of data from experiments with a table-top Franka Panda robot arm collected through teleoperation. We refer to the resulting action-conditioned model as V-JEPA 2-AC, and inSection 4we show that V-JEPA 2-AC can be used within a model-predictive control planning loop to plan actions in new environments.\n8\n300 400 500 600 700 800 900 1,000\n85.5\n86\n86.5\n87\n87.5\n88\nVIT-L\nVIT-H\nVIT-g\n参数量(百万)\nAverage Accuracy\n模型规模扩展\n16 帧\n32 帧\n64 帧\n0\n0.5\n1\n1.5\n2\n2.5\n·104\nTraining GPU-Days\n384p 视频的训练效率。\n渐进式训练 单一分辨率训练\n16 32 64\n86.6\n86.8\n87\n87.2\n87.4\n87.6\n87.8\nViT-g\n帧数\nAverage Accuracy\n预训练期间扩展视频时长\n图 5 模型扩展。我们探索了模型规模和输入视频分辨率扩展的影响。所有模型均在 VideoMix22M 预训练数据集上训练。 (左)六项理解任务的平均性能随模型规模的变化。模型以恒定学习率训练,直至下游任务性能趋于平稳。随后我们使 用 256 × 256 分辨率的 64 帧对模型进行冷却,并报告冷却后的性能。将模型规模从 300M 扩展到 1B 参数可带来 +1.7 个百分点的平均提升。(中)ViT‐g 在 A100 GPU 上以 384 × 384 分辨率训练不同每片段帧数视频时的训练时 间(GPU 天数)。我们将渐进分辨率训练(16 帧 / 256 × 256 分辨率下 252K 次迭代,随后在 384 × 384 分辨率下 进行 12K 次冷却迭代)与全分辨率训练的预计时间进行比较。渐进训练可提供